message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AgentforcePharmaGrid: Agentforce Grid–Driven Inter-Store Inventory Transfers with DEA Compliance and Audit Trail for Salesforce"
abstract: >-
  AgentforcePharmaGrid is a Salesforce-native solution for retail pharmacy
  inter-store inventory transfers, driven entirely from an Agentforce Grid
  component. It enforces DEA Schedule II compliance as a hard stop, applies
  cold-chain capability matching and a 30-day near-expiry source exclusion,
  proposes a transfer quantity capped at 50% of source surplus, and executes
  the move atomically with savepoint rollback while writing an immutable
  Transfer_Log__c audit record. The architecture uses a Service / Selector /
  Invocable Action pattern with a Flow as the Grid-button bridge and a
  Prompt Template that generates per-row recommendations.
